WEBVTT

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.030
What's the matter, Shii?

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.800
Honda-san fainted.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.340
Shii, how is Honda-san?

00:01:58.760 --> 00:01:59.840
Aya...

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.720
I'm really sorry, but Honda-san...

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:10.560
She looked at too many manga
for men and can barely breathe.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.560
What?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.990
Thank you so much
for coming to see me.

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:23.580
It's just a cold, I'll be up and about in no time.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.620
The season is changing.
Get a good rest.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.790
Thank you.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.320
How nice of you to come so far.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.720
Oh, we're sorry we came unannounced.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.970
Your mother is out today?

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:45.850
She's busy at work, but she said
she'll try to be home early.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:53.040
37.9 degrees.
It's pretty high.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.780
Will you stay with Tamaki
for just a while?

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:01.660
I'm going to the pharmacy
to buy cold medicine.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.280
In that case, we can go.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.240
The way there is pretty complicated.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.280
It's on the other side of the station, in a maze of shops.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.250
I understand, we'll stay here.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.590
It's Sunday, so we have lots of time.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.500
All right, I'll leave it to you.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.800
Don't worry. Take your time.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.220
Be careful.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.870
Shii, you mentioned lots of
manga for men?

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:30.480
Oh, that's...

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:35.610
I thought I could at least
draw the characters, but it's no good.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:36.940
No good?

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:41.900
All the faces I draw when I'm feeling sick
look like old men.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.830
But at least you seem to be better.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.000
Shii, don't be so dramatic next time.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.560
I'm not good when I go out by myself,

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:59.010
and my communication skills are low,
so I wanted someone to come with me...

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.220
You're always so negative.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.010
And I left a present at your house.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:06.890
When?!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.440
Hello?

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.570
Hi, Aya's little brother?

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:17.980
What?

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:21.110
In the living room is a story Aya wrote.
You can read it.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.900
What'd you do?!
My family doesn't know about it!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.950
Aya, not so loud.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.080
Oh, sorry, Honda-san!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.370
I-I'm sorry. It's okay.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.170
Hello, what's going on?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:39.920
Oh, it's nothing. Please highlight
any typos or misspellings.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.010
Haruma's gonna tease me.
I just know it!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:51.350
Hey, don't laugh!
You just laughed at my story!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.440
This is proofreading!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:57.440
Why do I have to help you?!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:58.940
He noticed.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.320
I'm sorry. Is it hard to rest when we're here?

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.110
We can work in the hallway.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.860
N-no, it's okay.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.040
Rather, I should apologize.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.580
I haven't finished today's work...

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.790
Yes, we needed
one character expression.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.410
Fujikawa-san, please finish
as soon as you can.

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:22.170
<i>You don't have to worry, President.</i>

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:27.320
Um, I'm sorry I'm stuck in bed
and can't do anything.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:28.800
What are you saying?

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:33.220
Today, this room is our clubroom. That's enough.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.730
<i>What does she mean?</i>

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.610
<i>Oh. Now she's writing a program.</i>

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:48.990
<i>Does she want me to hurry up and draw?</i>

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.040
We'll be here until you get well.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:58.380
<i>Or does she mean that if it's programming, I could do that even in this state?</i>

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:03.420
President, I'm really not sure...

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.590
Umm... Aya, please watch her!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.260
Hey, running away?!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.600
Oh, Senpai!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.270
I'll be lonely.
Please don't leave me, Senpai.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.270
What are you doing to Honda-senpai, you stupid sister?!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.770
Shut up, Otouto!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.700
You and the president are childhood friends, right?

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.610
Yeah, from about fifth grade.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:34.540
She's never been much
of a talker.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.330
She was even nervous around
Fujikawa-san in the beginning.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.790
She hates crowds too.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:44.300
Even at winter Comiket, she got back on the train and went home. Comi-

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:49.130
Winter Comiket? You mean,
the winter Comic Market?

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:54.220
Y-yeah! Winter Comiket.
Yup, you're picking up lots of knowledge.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.380
Anyway, getting back to Shii...

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.750
She's never been good
at expressing her opinions.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.690
But lately, she's getting the hang
of being president.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:10.280
Before that overnighter, when I was late
finishing my plot...

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.120
Missing the deadline for the plot
bodes ill for the future.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.080
Do you want me to take over other tasks?

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:20.330
No! Since I set up the project,
I'll do it...

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.040
Would you rather let me take over other tasks,

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:27.960
or have me reveal your black secrets to
everyone if you miss the next deadline?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.880
Please take over. Thank you.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.090
Thoughtful, isn't she?

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.100
The president is late.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.440
Um... what did she mean earlier?

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.360
Huh? Earlier?

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.240
About this being the clubroom for the day.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:52.070
Was she upset because
I wasn't doing any work?

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.910
I think she was having fun.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.070
You can tell?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.870
I've known her a long time.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.490
This is our clubroom today.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:03.960
You're battling a cold in here. She means you don't have to think about work.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.380
You're already doing your best as a club member. Something like that.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:12.970
Shii cherishes the SNS Club
in her own way.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.680
Besides, you always give it your all.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.220
She wouldn't show disappointment
in her precious kouhai...

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.440
Can you stop analyzing me?
You chuunibyou.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.060
Oh, welcome back.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.360
Oh, so you were making rice porridge!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:31.360
I just microwaved it.
I brought it from home.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.110
Thank you!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.280
Thank you for the food!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:41.580
There's lots of time in the schedule
until the summer Comiket.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.410
It's good!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.540
So don't worry about the work load.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.000
Really?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.710
We're still in early June.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.760
We planned for all character sprites to be finished by the end of this month,

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:53.550
and the line drawings are nearly done.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.220
You'll have a whole month
to color and finish.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:59.310
July is exam month, so let's take it slow.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:02.600
And once you draw the title screen picture, we'll easily finish it in time.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.690
I'm so relieved.
You're very dependable, President.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.320
Please concentrate on
getting over your cold.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.490
What happened, Aya? You're so quiet.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.160
I-I hope you didn't catch my cold?!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.240
No! I'm fine!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.620
I'm back.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.830
I bought medicine.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.960
Grandma's home.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.300
Now drink your medicine
and rest up.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:31.840
I will!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:37.510
<i>I was over my cold by the following day.</i>

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.770
Honda-chan! Over here!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.680
Hello, Senpai.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.890
Sorry I couldn't go yesterday.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:50.310
The president told me to work at home.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.820
I'm sorry I worried you.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.860
Thank you for coming yesterday.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.570
Seki-senpai, please say hello to Haruma-kun.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.700
Yeah, sure.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:05.450
Aneki, you were able to write a love story
when you've never been in love?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:15.420
<i>My time in high school is a joy
thanks to my senpai.</i>

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.550
<i>I wish every day were like this.</i>

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.560
Oh yeah, we didn't make it.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:23.350
Didn't make what?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:24.640
The summer Comiket.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:36.740
Huh?!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.240
Sorry, I couldn't bring myself
to tell you yesterday!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:48.160
Oh well... there was always that possibility.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.790
Umm... so...?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:54.420
Even if we complete our game,
we can't enter it.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:54.880
What?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.420
B-but it's okay!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.760
I thought this might happen, so I entered the club in a disk-only event, and we're in!

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:05.260
We just have to finish
in time for this! Thank goodness!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.390
When does it start?

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:12.860
In six days.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.400
I'm heading out.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.660
Tama-chan! How come you're in uniform?

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.200
Today's Saturday.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.910
I have an overnight club activity.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.000
You mean to work on the game?

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:31.750
Yeah.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.380
Did you get permission?

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.380
We asked the Student Council.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:40.220
The deadline is really tight,
but we decided to go for it.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.970
We all worked hard on it, so...

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:47.180
See! Scanner-san, my sketchbook,
and overnight things.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.730
When do you have to finish?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.810
By tonight.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:56.110
We're going straight to the event thing tomorrow morning.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.780
See you, Yumine.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.150
Okay, good luck.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.410
<i>I doubt you'll use that pillow.</i>

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.200
Good morning!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.450
Thanks for coming so far.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.290
Okay, we're all here.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.120
Fujikawa-senpai can't come?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:18.590
She needs her equipment at home
to finish the songs and stuff.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:23.550
Otherwise, she's limited to
playing around with the melody.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:26.720
She wants good headphones
for mastering the music.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:30.350
It sounds so professional, even though I don't really understand.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.430
Now then...

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.440
Did you bring what I requested?

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:39.190
Items to give us a second wind
when we've reached our limit, right?

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:41.900
I brought these.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.700
These are mine.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.570
What'd you bring, Honda-san?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.370
I brought this.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.660
A photo?

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.540
Is that your dad?

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:54.290
Yes!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:58.750
I didn't get good grades before.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.630
But whenever I looked at this photo,
I was inspired to study for Dad.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.430
S-so bright.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.640
Did we do the right thing, bringing such an angel to this battlefield?!

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:11.600
Okay, let's confirm our tasks.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:16.190
Honda-san, it would be great if you can
complete the cover art by 7 p.m.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.310
R-right!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:20.690
You can use my extra notebook PC.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.110
O-okay!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.380
Wait a minute!
How come I have more work?!

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:27.800
It's your penalty for not telling us about Comiket for a whole day.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:33.620
I figured there was no way
we'd finish in a week.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.120
Even now, I'd say we should postpone this...

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.540
Papa, I'll do my best today
with my senpai.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.300
Oh, whatever! Let's just get to work instead of worrying!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.420
Good attitude.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.740
Huh? It's from Fujikawa-san.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:55.140
Using open source libraries for
sound effects is too ordinary.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.690
Can I start with the sound effects instead of the BGM?

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.480
We don't have time,
so stick to the schedule!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.990
Yikes! I will!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.450
Um... will this do for a line drawing?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.330
Yes, that looks good.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:17.660
But it looks a bit different from what I've already drawn.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.980
Really? It's not noticeable.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:23.750
It's just that it bothers me when I look at the previous drawings.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.420
So kinda want to redo them...

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.970
We don't have time.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.010
Y-you're right!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.720
My designs are pretty much done.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.310
Wow... I like the cool monotone effect.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:41.340
You just randomly filled it in with colors and slapped icons on top.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.020
It's called flat design and it's trending right now.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.530
Yeah, but it looks sort of amateurish—

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.240
It's flat design.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.490
Oh, right.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:06.380
<i>Lunch made me sleepy.</i>

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:09.800
<i>But I have to hang in there.
We don't have time.</i>

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.090
<i>Those two are working hard.</i>

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:16.470
Scripting, I can do that in the blink of an eye!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:21.980
A bug at the front gate...
A fatal error at the back gate...

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.650
Bug... Bug... Bug...

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:24.570
I've got to work hard.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.360
It's evening. How's it going?

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.490
I-I'm okay... It's going okay...

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.030
No!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.280
I have to focus more!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.910
Senpai, if you cross your legs while wearing a skirt...

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:37.910
Not now!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.290
Hello! Delivering three tantanmen!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.420
Later!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.050
Did they deliver the noodles we ordered?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:47.960
Later!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.300
Um, I'm interested in joining the club...

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.590
Later!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.350
I'm done!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.770
Some small details are bothering me, but this should be fine.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:10.900
Look at the time! We were told to finish by 7!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.990
I-I'm sorry it's late! Um...

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.780
Oh, Honda-san...

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.330
I can't reach Fujikawa-san.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:26.290
M-maybe she's just taking a nap.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.880
For five hours?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.590
Um...

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.630
I'll try again.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.600
She's not answering.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.520
I'll go over to her house!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.780
I'm sorry. I don't know her address.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:52.740
Maybe we got carried away and asked her for too many songs.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.950
Perhaps...

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:59.830
She probably had songs
in mind, but we insisted...

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:03.710
In the worst case, she may just quit.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.790
Anyway, we have to do what we can.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.920
I guess. We can look for
open source music.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:10.880
Why?

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.300
President... Seki-senpai...

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.680
Aren't you going to believe in Fujikawa-senpai?

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:25.060
I don't know her as well as you two.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:29.690
But we had fun working together to create this!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:34.640
We did overnighters, went shopping...
So I'm sure Fujikawa-senpai is...

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.410
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.660
I'm sure...

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:45.540
<i>How do I know that Fujikawa-senpai
is doing her best?</i>

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:50.420
<i>Can I really say...</i>

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.590
<i>that we've had fun doing this?</i>

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.950
Don't get so depressed.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:59.720
I told you at the start
that creating games isn't easy.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.720
We're just members of
a school club.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.980
We can't force anyone
to work on a game.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.440
We don't pay anyone to work.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:13.730
If she's out, then we just
have to accept it.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:20.200
But still... I still want to
believe in Fujikawa-senpai.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:37.090
Hurrah! I finished the six songs
you ordered! I'm going to sleep now!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:38.680
Woah, that's just like her!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.340
Oh my...

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.100
It's so good that you'd never think this was improvised.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:49.440
Yes, I think it's a great melody!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:57.610
Okay, it's our last spurt!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.240
Right!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.360
Okay.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:02.950
Aya, go to the store and make copies of Honda-san's drawings. I need 30!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.030
Roger!

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.580
I finished one sprite expression.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.040
Okay, I'll load it.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.380
Did you open and play it?

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.170
Not yet, but it'll probably work.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.040
What about the installer?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.060
Zip it.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.010
I'm done with the last sprite expression. I'm sending it over now.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.800
Loading it now.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.080
Uploading the master.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.020
Let's burn the discs!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:28.560
Yes!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.800
Stella no Mahou.
That's a cute title.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:44.400
Stella is the name of the heroine,

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:47.240
but there's actually
a hidden meaning.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.790
A hidden meaning?

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:52.330
Yes. Role-sharing in a game.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.400
Role-sharing?

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.420
Writing the program,
creating the art and music...

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:02.590
You can't create a game by merely
collecting individual pieces of work.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:08.850
Having someone in charge
to synergize the pieces into a whole...

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:12.390
This phenomenon is what I call
stellar magic!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.900
And "stella" means star!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:20.650
Yes, there are five aspects, like a star...
hence, Stella no Mahou.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.380
Huh? It's morning.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:41.590
That's right... We worked in
the club room until late...

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.800
Stella no Mahou...

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.770
We did it, Papa.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:58.320
I feel like I've overcome
one giant wall.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:01.570
Hey, there's no time to relax!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.320
We're going to exhibit and sell these.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.650
R-right!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:08.240
It's so bright!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.990
Did you get much sleep?

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.660
Just a short nap.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.830
But it's okay! I'm so excited,
I'm not tired at all!

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:21.090
This event is pretty huge.
And I'm raring to go!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:24.010
How many circles will there be?

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.430
180!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.140
Last year's attendance was 1,300!

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.840
Yes, it's quite a huge event.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:35.270
<i>I was so focused,
I didn't think of anything else.</i>

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:39.300
<i>But this is my first
doujin game event.</i>

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.730
<i>I wonder what it'll be like?</i>

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:45.320
Honda-san, hurry up!

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.530
O-okay!

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:24.020
Finished!

00:23:24.020 --> 00:23:25.460
Our treasured work, pyon!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.720
I can't go on anymore.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:30.340
I heard you defended me?

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:32.720
Tama-chan's the seme!
